# Deep Learning NLP Text Classifier

## Objective
Build a text classification model using deep learning and Natural Language Processing (NLP).

## Technologies
- Python
- PyTorch
- Natural Language Processing
- Neural Networks

## Features
- Converts text into tokens.
- Builds a vocabulary.
- Converts words into numerical sequences.
- Trains a neural network for sentiment classification.
- Predicts positive or negative sentiment.

## How to Run
Install dependencies:

`pip install -r requirements.txt`

Run the program:

`python nlp_classifier.py`

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates a basic NLP text classification pipeline using a PyTorch neural network.
